al win.\n\nFinal Python all-kernel sweep, three processes per arm and harness count multiplier 5 with per-kernel scaling:\n\n| Kernel | Mean before ms | Mean after ms | Wall before ms | Wall after ms |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| ai | 52.57 | 52.58 | 489.26 | 487.92 |\n| chaos | 24.42 | 25.13 | 487.94 | 488.82 |\n| crypto_pyaes | 26.01 | 26.18 | 251.71 | 252.08 |\n| deltablue | 20.63 | 20.73 | 228.40 | 230.77 |\n| fannkuch | 42.61 | 42.27 | 277.31 | 276.09 |\n| float | 7.91 | 7.42 | 104.17 | 103.00 |\n| go | 18.96 | 19.07 | 445.99 | 453.58 |\n| hexiom2 | 3532.42 | 3411.38 | 3687.33 | 3572.51 |\n| json_bench | 478.53 | 484.20 | 2481.19 | 2511.18 |\n| meteor-contest | 58.61 | 58.46 | 525.74 | 530.04 |\n| nbody_modified | 8.01 | 7.66 | 144.15 | 139.54 |\n| nqueens | 6827.39 | 6656.65 | 7080.89 | 6921.24 |\n| pyflate-fast | 277.58 | 280.41 | 3232.65 | 3172.97 |\n| raytrace-simple | 95.27 | 94.91 | 1277.85 | 1267.36 |\n| richards | 1.17 | 1.41 | 131.03 | 135.36 |\n| scimark_fft | 353.72 | 354.31 | 549.22 | 543.26 |\n| scimark_lu | 498.17 | 485.68 | 693.32 | 678.98 |\n| scimark_montecarlo | 99.59 | 101.94 | 294.26 | 292.61 |\n| scimark_sor | 11508.67 | 11844.37 | 11700.39 | 12048.26 |\n| scimark_sparsematmult | 142.97 | 146.28 | 332.75 | 338.38 |\n| spectral-norm | 32.60 | 33.88 | 238.91 | 244.19 |\n| telco | 16.41 | 16.41 | 286.03 | 288.13 |\n\nStandard-count Python confirmation (count multiplier 50), three processes per arm:\n\n| Kernel | Mean before ms | Mean after ms | Wall before ms | Wall after ms |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| fannkuch | 40.93 | 40.69 | 2110.68 | 2099.12 |\n| crypto_pyaes | 14.45 | 14.66 | 845.40 | 853.89 |\n| nbody_modified | 4.79 | 4.86 | 340.16 | 343.09 |\n| richards | 1.34 | 1.34 | 193.77 | 191.95 |\n| scimark_sparsematmult | 101.70 | 100.09 | 700.92 | 691.27 |\n\nSame-executable Python off/on confirmation, standard counts and three processes per arm:\n\n| Kernel | Mean off ms | Mean on ms | Wall off ms | Wall on ms |\n| 